OL,3,ALegendary Nigerian actor Olu Jacobs
OL,4,Adies aged 84
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlu Jacobs, one of Nigeria's best known
OL,7,Factors, whose career spanned several
OL,8,Fdecades across theatre, television and
OL,9,Ffilm, has died at the age of 84.
OL,11,FHis wife, veteran actress Joke Silva,
OL,12,Fannounced his death and asked for
OL,13,Fprivacy while the family mourns.
OL,15,FSilva announced his passing in a
OL,16,Fstatement describing the celebrated
OL,17,Factor as "The Lion of Lufodo" and
OL,18,Fsaying his life was "well lived and
OL,19,Ffought".
